00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.700
Whoops. Excuse me.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:57.000
Jumping to the conclusion, Yuri is human.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.160
She isn't a Huge.

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:03.250
You want to know why, right?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.500
I analyzed Yuri's genome,

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.080
and it matches a human's
with 99.9 percent certainty.

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:11.080
But not 100 percent?

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.540
No, of course not.

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:15.450
A 100-percent human doesn't exist.

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:17.540
I mean, are you and me the same?

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:20.410
No, we're different. We're all different.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:24.790
Acquiring diversity is the
root of life's survival strategies.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.040
Genomes are being updated every day.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.750
So, of course we're different.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:32.330
You and I are 99.9 percent human, too.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:33.790
But she's a Huge!

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:35.160
About that.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:39.540
"A genetically human being shall be
considered human regardless of origin."

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:43.540
That's an international treaty
that came into effect 20 years ago,

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:47.160
back when ethically
dubious research was rampant.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:50.660
Our country ratified it, too, of course.
Only last year, though.

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:52.410
But a Huge is a Huge!

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:54.160
There are no exceptions!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.290
By the way, we've also confirmed that

00:15:56.290 --> 00:16:01.080
Yuri's Huge-derived genes lost their
function when she became humanoid.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:07.580
And that's even supported by
materials supplied by Grand Guignol.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:12.160
Man. Without these, it would
have taken me a whole extra day.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:17.620
Let me say it again: Yuri is human!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:22.120
Then I suppose that also makes her a Lily.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.620
And disobeying orders?!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.750
The order to capture her itself was baseless.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.250
Might I suggest you rescind it?

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:32.700
Our response was appropriate!

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:37.540
The circumstances were obscure;
you couldn't help it.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:42.450
The academy will take responsibility
for the two Lilies' punishment.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:46.450
Needless to say, now that Yuri
has been identified as a Lily,

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:52.290
this academy will take custody of her,
in accordance with precedent.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:58.250
Let's hear it for precedent.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:07.160
How long will we stay here, Riri?

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:08.870
I don't know.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:13.000
We left on the spur of the moment, but...

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.950
Run, Riri.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:18.410
There's a deserted town to the west.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:20.910
Buy time for now.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:23.790
I'll come for you there.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:24.870
Don't worry.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:29.500
If we stay here, Yuyu and
the others will come join us.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:32.370
I wonder if all Huge are like me.

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:35.040
What? No way. You're nothing alike.

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:37.700
But I'm a Huge, right?

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:45.120
No. You're you, Yuri--a normal girl.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:50.700
So, if I went to join the Huge,
there'd be no place for me there, either.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:58.120
I wasn't born this way because I wanted to be.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.540
Do you ever feel that way, Riri?

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.120
Oh, all the time.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:07.540
I wish I had beautiful,
silky, black hair like Yuyu,

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:12.410
or that I could be kind
and cool all the time like she is.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:16.660
Then, Yuyu must be happy
she was born Yuyu, huh?

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.200
Sorry.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.370
You don't have to become anything.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:30.040
You're perfect the way you are, Yuri.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.750
But you know,

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.660
I became Yuri because that's what you named me.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:40.500
That made me really happy.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:43.870
Don't worry. You'll have a home to go back to.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:46.450
We'll all make one for you.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.870
Yes. Let's go home together.

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:57.750
Yuyu. Everyone.

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:01.200
The Acting Chairman and Moyu
convinced the government.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.120
They recognized Yuri as a human and a Lily.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.540
It's safe now.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.790
I was hoping for a dramatic escape with Riri.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.370
Is it over already?

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.830
The arrest order for you got rescinded, Riri.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:13.830
Way to go!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:17.160
A-Arrest?! Did that really happen?

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:19.950
Huh? But how did you find us?

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:20.830
Oh,

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:23.700
it was really obvious.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:30.120
Yes, there was no battle, and...

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:31.540
What?

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:05.750
Evacuate!

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.250
"Reginleif (W.E.T.P.) first year"
"Rokkaku Shiori"

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:14.120
It shredded the atmosphere.

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:15.620
What is that Huge?

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:18.410
It's using Magie directly to attack?

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:22.120
It should run out of Magie
right away if it does that.

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:23.450
That's a Huge?

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.790
Yeah, I think so.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:26.700
But...

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:32.660
Huge are controlled by Magie,
but they shouldn't be able to control it.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.410
So, how...?

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:36.120
Are we going to beat that Huge?

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:39.870
Yeah, we need to get back to Yurigaoka and--

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:44.620
That's Shukuchi, my Rare Skill!

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:48.450
Yuri's running on the ocean!

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:52.040
You can tell by looking,
but even I've never done that!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.700
Phase Transcendence...

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:56.000
She combined it with my technique.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.750
Then she's a Dual Skiller? Or is it enhancement?

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:03.370
But she'll soon exhaust her Magie!

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.870
It's connected to that place.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:09.540
--Riri!

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:11.950
--You can't catch up on foot!
--Riri!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:18.160
She's not ready for a real battle yet.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:24.330
If we take too many of those,
Yurigaoka is done for.

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:25.660
Something's strange!

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:28.540
Its Magie and the nest's
are calling to each other.

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:31.950
It's like it's sucking the Magie from the nest.

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:37.870
If the nest is supplying it with Magie,
it can use an unlimited supply.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.580
It can't be.

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:01.080
I can fight, too!

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:03.950
I'm a Yurigaoka Lily!

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.040
Riri,

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:37.830
I did it.

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:40.000
I cut Yuri's hair in the morning.

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:43.950
It was getting too long.

00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:47.500
Yuri was smiling.

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:50.000
So was I.

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:52.330
But...

00:23:52.330 --> 00:23:54.410
Why?

00:24:03.950 --> 00:24:06.950
"To be continued"

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:17.830
<i>I’ll never regret having been born</i>

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:25.250
<i>No matter how I end up feeling, I’m happy</i>

00:24:25.250 --> 00:24:29.870
<i>I want to watch your gentle breaths</i>

00:24:29.870 --> 00:24:36.580
<i>It doesn’t matter if there’s</i>
<i>nothing certain there</i>

00:24:36.580 --> 00:24:42.120
<i>Strength is fleeting and tantalizing</i>

00:24:42.120 --> 00:24:49.330
<i>Being with you taught me that</i>
<i>and where I should go</i>

00:24:49.330 --> 00:24:55.790
<i>This dream is so kind and calm</i>

00:24:55.790 --> 00:25:01.540
<i>I don’t want to let it go,</i>
<i>even for the blink of an eye</i>

00:25:01.540 --> 00:25:07.950
<i>Being alone is frightening and lonely</i>

00:25:07.950 --> 00:25:17.700
<i>But look how warm my memories are</i>

00:25:19.080 --> 00:25:25.250
<i>So, I don’t mind blinking</i>

00:25:37.000 --> 00:25:42.000
"Next time"
"Episode 10"

00:25:42.000 --> 00:25:46.910
"Illustration: Ishida Hiromichi"
